  "details": "I have been playing VRChat for many years, and recently, I’ve wanted to change my home world to something more original. However, I really enjoy how the official home world updates for anniversaries, news, and events, and I don’t want to miss out on that experience.\n\nI was wondering if there could be a prefab asset that displays updates about the official home world, which I could place in my custom world. For example, it could recreate the stage in front of the mirror from the current official home world.\n\nWould it be possible to create such an asset? I hope something like this can be made!",
